    {
      "id": "panelt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 25,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "本次重排与补充要点（设计蓝图，确认后写入 RFC.txt 与本地化）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2142,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "1. 21 列规整网格：四路开局 → 五路建军 → 三种结局，行距统一，消除中央断档与左右错位。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2169,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "2. 新增 3 个中枢国策：巩固统一战线 → 召开联席会议 → 抗战建国纲领，向下衔接「新训政」。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2196,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "3. 修复「新训政」无前置可首日秒点的问题：现须先完成「抗战建国纲领」。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2223,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "4. 消除重名：new_focus_25「精兵强将」改名「整编精兵」，与右侧开局的「精兵强将」区分。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2250,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "5. 「第二次国共合作」「中国民主同盟」上移一行，与「军队战斗力问题」「解决军队开支」同层汇聚。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nl5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2277,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#0A0A0A",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "6. 三种结局保持不变：平民阶级专政（左）/ 伟大复兴之路（中）/ 亚洲新自由灯塔（右）。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nr0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2142,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#404040",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "7. 六组互斥全部保留（深入群众↔精兵强将、生根发展↔整编精兵、反腐↔部队经商等）。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nr1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2169,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#404040",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "8. 结局共享节点保留：为人民服务（左/中）、确保地方稳定与中国制造（中/右），天然保证三结局互斥。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nr2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2196,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#404040",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "9. 「职业化军队」「军队国家化」为军队线终点加成国策，不再下接经济线。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nr3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2223,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#404040",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "10. 3 个新增国策的具体效果、图标与本地化键在实施阶段补齐，本图只定位置与连接。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "nr4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2250,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 20,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#404040",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "11. 本次仅调整位置、前置与命名，不改动既有 103 个国策的效果数值。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "groupIds": [],
      "locked": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "boundElements": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-01T05:01:54.337Z",
